{"id":"mumm","lemma":"Mumm","pos":"noun","rank":4383,"glosses":["moxie, guts, grit, balls, nerve"],"ipa":"/mʊm/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8b/De-Mumm.ogg/De-Mumm.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Mummes"},"examples":[{"text":"Er hat Mumm.","en":"He has guts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/69348","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},null]},{"text":"Du hast ganz schön Mumm.","en":"You've got a lot of guts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760791","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"pretty, quite, rather"]]},{"text":"Ich glaube, du hast nicht den Mumm dazu.","en":"I don't think you have the guts to do that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"in addition to it"}]},{"text":"Das hat Mumm erfordert.","en":"That took guts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/81355","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"to necessitate","l":"erfordern"}]},{"text":"Niemand hatte den Mumm, den Mund aufzumachen.","en":"No one had the guts to say anything.","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"mouth of a person"},{"g":"to open","l":"aufmachen"}]}]}